# Venture Financing Due Diligence Request List

{% agreement-section type="cover_terms" %}
## Cover Sheet

{% cover-terms %}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Requesting Firm" field="requesting_firm_name" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Company" field="company_name" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Delivery Date" field="request_date" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Response Due Date" field="response_due_date" /%}
